{"updated":"2026-11-21T17:42:15.469Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: COP31: Deep divisions persist over energy, finance and science. Elsewhere, FBI criminal database hacked. And man convicted of starting palisades fire. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 10.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 8.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 14.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 43 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.8 near 105 km NE of Lospalos, Timor Leste. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.17,0.22,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.81,0.93,1.1,1.54,1.66,1.71,1.74,1.76,1.81,1.83,1.86,1.88,1.94,1.99,2.07,2.13,2.18,2.22,2.26,2.31,2.35,2.38,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.57,2.61,2.66,2.71,2.75,2.8,2.86,2.93,3,3.11,3.23,3.35,3.39,3.42,3.46,3.52,3.56,3.62,3.74,3.83,3.89,3.96,3.99,4.05,4.1,4.13,4.18,4.2,4.23,4.27,4.3,4.32,4.34,4.39,4.43,4.52,4.57,4.63,4.69,4.75,4.79,4.84,4.89,4.91,4.98,5.1,5.25,5.42,5.93,6,6.08,6.2,6.53,6.8,7.01,7.52,7.61,7.66,7.72,7.77,7.84,7.87,7.93,7.98,8.03,8.09,8.14,8.17,8.23,8.29,8.36,8.42,8.47,8.53,8.6,8.72,8.8,8.87,8.93,9,9.04,9.09,9.11,9.18,9.27,9.31,9.35,9.4,9.48,9.61,9.68,9.78,9.85,9.96,10.04,10.11,10.18,10.24,10.3,10.34,10.4,10.45,10.49,10.55,10.6,10.72,10.83,10.9,10.95,10.99,11.17,11.19,11.57,11.69,11.76,11.82,11.88,11.91,11.97,12,12.06,12.18,12.27,12.33,12.5,12.59,12.79,12.89,12.95,12.98,13.03,13.07,13.11,13.15,13.2,13.23,13.32,13.36,13.46,13.51,13.6,13.65,13.75,13.81,13.85,13.9,13.96,14.07,14.14,14.18,14.22,14.29,14.44,14.83,14.88,14.94,14.99,15.08,15.14,15.26,15.31,15.38,15.42,15.46,15.53,15.59,15.65,15.7,15.77,15.84,15.86,15.9,15.93,15.96,16.02,16.07,1